<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-2')">2</a>. The paramilitary wing of the Horizon Initiative, infamous for their zeal and aggression in line of duty.</div>
